<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 1.4 trln yen six-month Treasury bills.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 1.4 trln yen six-month Treasury bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday it was offering 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be November 11 and maturity date will be May 12, 1997.</p>
</text>
